WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.367 --> 00:00:02.635
-Hey, guys. We live
in a brand-driven society.

00:00:02.635 --> 00:00:04.103
[ Chuckles ]

00:00:04.103 --> 00:00:05.671
-Nice segue.
-How's that for a segue?

00:00:05.671 --> 00:00:07.173
Yeah. Yeah, how's that?
-That's great. I'm with you.

00:00:07.173 --> 00:00:10.109
I'm still here.
-Y-Y-Y-Yeah.

00:00:10.109 --> 00:00:11.878
Name recognition is everything.

00:00:11.878 --> 00:00:15.347
The problem is what makes
a good name for one thing

00:00:15.347 --> 00:00:17.150
might make a bad name
for something else

00:00:17.150 --> 00:00:18.851
or a great name
for something else.

00:00:18.851 --> 00:00:20.653
So with that in mind, it's time
for a segment we call

00:00:20.653 --> 00:00:22.988
"Good Name, Bad Name,
Great Name."

00:00:22.988 --> 00:00:26.860
-♪ "Good Name, Bad Name,
Great Name," yes ♪

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:31.264
-First up,
we have "Don't Start Now."

00:00:31.264 --> 00:00:33.933
That's a good name
for a Dua Lipa song.

00:00:33.933 --> 00:00:37.437
It's a bad name for a racehorse.
[ Light laughter ]

00:00:37.437 --> 00:00:39.506 line:0%
A great name for
this year's flu season.

00:00:39.506 --> 00:00:41.140 line:0%
[ Laughter, groaning ]
Please, don't start now.

00:00:41.140 --> 00:00:42.508 line:0%
Please don't start.

00:00:42.508 --> 00:00:45.344 line:0%
After that, we have
"Little Fires Everywhere."

00:00:45.344 --> 00:00:47.580 line:0%
That's a good name
for a TV show...

00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:49.816 line:0%
a bad name
for a gender reveal party.

00:00:49.816 --> 00:00:51.450 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:51.450 --> 00:00:53.586 line:0%
It's a great name
for Trump's PR team.

00:00:53.586 --> 00:00:54.954 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:54.954 --> 00:00:57.356 line:0%
Next up we have "Prego."

00:00:57.356 --> 00:00:59.993 line:0%
That's a good name
for a tomato sauce,

00:00:59.993 --> 00:01:01.861 line:0%
a bad name
for a birth control pill.

00:01:01.861 --> 00:01:05.965 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:05.965 --> 00:01:07.633 line:0%
[ Cymbal clangs ]

00:01:07.633 --> 00:01:10.236 line:0%
It's a great name
for a drive-thru church.

00:01:10.236 --> 00:01:11.304 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:11.304 --> 00:01:14.407 line:0%
Pray-go. Pray-go.

00:01:14.407 --> 00:01:16.409 line:0%
-Aw, come on.
-♪ Hallelujah ♪

00:01:16.409 --> 00:01:18.477 line:0%
-That was the one.
That's all we want.

00:01:18.477 --> 00:01:19.712 line:0%
That was the one.

00:01:19.712 --> 00:01:23.115 line:0%
Up next we have
"Cheek to Cheek."

00:01:23.115 --> 00:01:25.551 line:0%
That's a good name
for a classic romantic song.

00:01:25.551 --> 00:01:28.521 line:0%
It's a bad name
for a Trump rally.

00:01:28.521 --> 00:01:30.890 line:0%
It's a great name
for seats on Spirit Airlines.

00:01:30.890 --> 00:01:32.592 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.592 --> 00:01:35.061 line:0%
And finally we have
"Oops!...I Did It Again."

00:01:35.061 --> 00:01:37.096 line:0%
That's a good name
for a pop song,

00:01:37.096 --> 00:01:39.399 line:0%
a bad name for Trump's
re-election slogan,

00:01:39.399 --> 00:01:42.035 line:0%
a great name
for an adult diaper.

00:01:42.035 --> 00:01:44.437 line:0%
That's all for "Good Name,
Bad Name, Great Name."

